## 2. OSM Map Data - ODbL License

This project uses map data from OpenStreetMap, which follows the Open Data Commons Open Database License (ODbL) v1.0.

When using this data, you must:
1. Attribution: You must attribute OpenStreetMap contributors.
2. Share-Alike: If you publicly use any derivative of this data, you must also share it under the ODbL license.
3. Keep open: Even for internal use, consider sharing under the same terms.

The full ODbL license text can be found at: https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/